--- task
id: t37
dataset: section8
kind: unattached branch snapshot

--- intent
Create a person with handle `$h` (name also `$h`) as an unattached branch snapshot instead of writing to the branch.

--- params
{"h": "ivy"}

--- edition2
query propose($h: String) as unattached branch {
  insert Person { handle: $h, name: $h }
}

--- edition3
query propose($h: String) as unattached branch {
  insert Person { handle: $h, name: $h }
}

--- check
query check($h: String) {
  match { $p: Person { handle: $h } }
  return { $p.name }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["p.name"]
